{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"3a0fdb7747d55515","type":"text","text":"Design (80%)","x":-859,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"033b6fc5b5f2ef64","type":"text","text":"Coding","x":4985,"y":-1203,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bd031c8e976f7104","type":"text","text":"Whether we operate in the global scale or local does not affect our design; it will be Malaysian Theme regardless. The point is to make Malaysian food appealing to both foreigners and locals. ","x":-120,"y":391,"width":520,"height":248,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8735d2707141705d","type":"text","text":"Our demographic","x":-113,"y":-143,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"513badb517a6655e","type":"text","text":"Since, we're opting to be a restaurant, age is an important factor; the webpages will be aimed towards teenagers, young adults, and adults. \n\nChildren demographic (*if needed*) will have a webpage/design separate from the rest of the webpages.","x":60,"y":-3,"width":520,"height":282,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0194569508379caf","type":"text","text":"Nationality","x":150,"y":331,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d8b8ea75e68dbb31","type":"text","text":"Age","x":330,"y":-63,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f896001dfdac8a8c","type":"text","text":"We need to find out the:\n1. Description \n2. Ingredients\n3. Nutritional values (per serving)\n4. The Instructions\n5. *And a lot of pictures*","x":-1937,"y":420,"width":372,"height":332,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"030e5d8a06cce29b","type":"text","text":"Why not meal-kit company?","x":-1796,"y":195,"width":279,"height":105},
		{"id":"9c514f1cb1632ada","type":"text","text":"Who are we?","x":-1537,"y":0,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bb8fea836accfa6d","type":"text","text":"We are a company that sells Malaysian-based cuisines.\n","x":-1381,"y":140,"width":350,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"6ed80aef18165953","type":"text","text":"We will pretend to be a well-received franchise in Malaysia that has opened a lot of branches across Malaysia (*or global*)","x":-1162,"y":329,"width":451,"height":183,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f2861694186d6b20","type":"text","text":"Light Mode and Dark mode\nAnimations\nInteractive maps\nInteractive cards","x":-282,"y":-955,"width":419,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"966761ab48c3880e","type":"text","text":"Features","x":-17,"y":-615,"width":214,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7ce7212d9142d1b7","type":"text","text":"Malaysian Theme \nTropical Theme\nUsage of shapes","x":-1360,"y":-1039,"width":444,"height":269,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b15f81d1dc171067","type":"text","text":"Graphics","x":-1064,"y":-540,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"12f01856f449d013","type":"text","text":"Red    - Pending\nYellow - Ongoing\nGreen  - Completed\n*italic* - Under consideration","x":-734,"y":-745,"width":449,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b980a5b9b0ae953f","type":"text","text":"Draft","x":-2187,"y":-625,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"da01f1d72200ccab","type":"file","file":"Assignments/Year 2/Semester 1/Front-End Web Development/Culinary.canvas","x":-2693,"y":-585,"width":506,"height":400},
		{"id":"3cddd7c5e8503605","type":"text","text":"Content","x":1375,"y":-432,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"07e3e3b1fa983293","type":"text","text":"Webpages\n1. Index\n2. Malaysian Cuisine Page\n\t1. Divide further into regions\n\t\t1. Peninsular\n\t\t\t1. Penang\n\t\t\t2. Kl\n\t\t\t3. Perak\n\t\t\t4. ....\n\t\t2. East Malaysia\n\t\t\t1. Sabah \n\t\t\t2. Sarawak\n\t2. Divide according to culture\n\t\t1. Chinese\n\t\t2. Malay\n\t\t3. Indian\n\t\t4. Sarakian\n\t\t5. Sabah\n\t\t6. *Fusion*\n3. About Malaysian Page\n4. About us Page\n\t1. *Blog posts* \n5. Pick-Up page\n6. FAQ page\n7. Contact us page i guess\n\n","x":1625,"y":-262,"width":465,"height":904,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"90fcef8d5be1b2d2","type":"text","text":"1. Jia En\n2. Alex\n3. Thomas\n4. Jimmy","x":3080,"y":-1254,"width":314,"height":162,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"55b0b2543f8c31de","type":"text","text":"Division","x":1965,"y":-1015,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a70441dfc7b666cd","type":"file","file":"Assignments/Year 2/Semester 1/Front-End Web Development/Diagrams/Culinary/oden-cart.png","x":2280,"y":-262,"width":604,"height":340},
		{"id":"b4887fca92dfa694","type":"file","file":"Assignments/Year 2/Semester 1/Front-End Web Development/Diagrams/Culinary/Templates/Layout Templates.md","x":3120,"y":1860,"width":748,"height":730},
		{"id":"81a4c65f17f30ee9","type":"file","file":"Assignments/Year 2/Semester 1/Front-End Web Development/Diagrams/Culinary/Templates/Catalogue.md","x":3560,"y":1185,"width":400,"height":672},
		{"id":"6391c95fc4457ff0","type":"text","text":"Layout of the page","x":3483,"y":592,"width":277,"height":50},
		{"id":"4be83c9135ec8923","type":"text","text":"Footer","x":500,"y":1615,"width":160,"height":60},
		{"id":"92f90814ec359975","type":"text","text":"We go for a horizontal layout - each block is placed adjacent to one another.\nThe links in each block will be arranged vertically\n**Content (not arranged)**\n1. Contact information\n2. Nagivation links\n3. Social media  links\n4. Copy right information\n5. Back to Top button\n6. Legal information","x":500,"y":1675,"width":460,"height":550,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"33cb7ea2e47d1aa2","type":"text","text":"So, How do we ACTUALLY put these into practice?","x":1218,"y":1135,"width":485,"height":100},
		{"id":"ae285c43ef068c86","type":"text","text":"We need to first determine the common theme.\n1. Colour\n2. Header\n3. Footer\n4. Layout of the page","x":1274,"y":1315,"width":373,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1abd828aeae5a274","type":"text","text":"**Basic requirements**\nA white background with blacks texts that changes colour on hover. A button that says Order now. \n\n**Alignment**\nLogo on the left\nLinks and the button the right\n\nLogo on the left\nLinks in the middle\nButton on the right","x":1161,"y":1890,"width":600,"height":460,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4a9b19b22b4ad46d","type":"text","text":"Header","x":1161,"y":1830,"width":160,"height":60},
		{"id":"1bd6a321067787c9","type":"text","text":"We will be using only 4 colours to represent our theme in our webpages\n1. Black\n3. White\n4. Accent 1\n5. Accent 2","x":1840,"y":1375,"width":440,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"405e43a33a5f624b","type":"text","text":"Colour","x":1840,"y":1315,"width":140,"height":60},
		{"id":"cf28c725aba6ae01","type":"text","text":"View the webpage as a collection of rows. \nEach row should be able to be discerned clearly from one another","x":1910,"y":970,"width":539,"height":215,"color":"2"},
